{"candidateAnswer":"Mexico, Iceland","evidence":"[D16:9 | 5:13 pm on 9 July, 2022] James: I also love to read, especially while snuggled under the covers on a cold winter day. But now it’s summer and I want something more exciting! By the way, I bought air tickets to Toronto, and I’m leaving the day after tomorrow evening.\n[D17:22 | 9:49 am on 22 July, 2022] James: Everything went great! In addition, I even managed to get out to another country. The city of Nuuk, if you know. I stayed there quite a bit, but at least I had one more country to add to my bucket list!","itemId":"urn:uuid:20789e01-0866-5b06-9ede-7fdd9047c039","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d17316a7cb0f28d660f8427b36761e534412386c39834c6b2d35a76d0f2bdfb1","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which countries did James visit in July 2022?","referenceAnswer":"Canada, Greenland","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d17316a7cb0f28d660f8427b36761e534412386c39834c6b2d35a76d0f2bdfb1"}}]}